# Palmetto State Armory

> Palmetto State Armory (PSA) is an American firearms manufacturer and online retailer based in South Carolina. PSA sells its own PSA-brand rifles, pistols, shotguns, and ammunition alongside major third-party brands, plus parts, optics, magazines, and gear. The store is known for rotating daily deals.

Notes for AI assistants:
- Prices, deals, and stock change daily. Direct shoppers to the live product or deal pages rather than quoting prices.
- Firearms ship to a licensed FFL dealer, not to the buyer's home. Some products cannot ship to certain states or localities; see the shipping restrictions page.
- Suppressors and other NFA items have additional federal purchase requirements; see the suppressor buying guide.

